                                "sense_id": "9c8cb676-935a-317c-bce2-174983868e5b",
                                "text": "It has a granular structure"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f33ddab-661b-41ac-a8bd-b0359bfa6bad",
                                "sense_id": "9c8cb676-935a-317c-bce2-174983868e5b",
                                "text": "This Whyn Dyke is bare at the cliffs ſeveral yards in height, and is near nine feet in width. It conſiſts of an inner part of a granular and ſomewhat porous texture..."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
